  "post_content": "<p>Ni&ntilde;os y ni&ntilde;as han disfrutado este martes en la plaza de Espa&ntilde;a con&nbsp;Zapatos en el Aire, espect&aacute;culo de circo y malabares, que forma parte del Festival de Teatro y Animaci&oacute;n Infantil, que se viene celebrando dentro de la Fira d&#39;Onda durante los &uacute;ltimo doce a&ntilde;os, y que cada d&iacute;a presenta una actuaci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zapatosenelairefestivalintantilfiraonda/img_4971.jpg\" alt=\"img_4971\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zapatosenelairefestivalintantilfiraonda/img_4972.jpg\" alt=\"img_4972\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zapatosenelairefestivalintantilfiraonda/img_4973.jpg\" alt=\"img_4973\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zapatosenelairefestivalintantilfiraonda/img_4974.jpg\" alt=\"img_4974\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zapatosenelairefestivalintantilfiraonda/img_4976.jpg\" alt=\"img_4976\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zapatosenelairefestivalintantilfiraonda/img_4978.jpg\" alt=\"img_4978\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zapatosenelairefestivalintantilfiraonda/img_4980.jpg\" alt=\"img_4980\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
